BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Full Frontal Comedy Is Back In The Attic!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261015T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261015T220000
UID:20261015-full-frontal-comedy-is-back-in-the-attic-2000
DESCRIPTION:Full Frontal Comedy is Indiana University’s longest-running 
 comedy group\, bringing laughs to Bloomington and beyond since 1994. FFC i
 s a student-led IU club. Every Full Frontal show kicks off with a prewritt
 en sketch before launching into a high-energy lineup of short-form improv 
 games followed by a long form section called a montage. No two shows are t
 he same\; everything is based on audience suggestions. Full Frontal’s cu
 rrent performing members are Kuran Patel\, Katherine Stalmah\, Marshall Za
 gotta\, Natalie Orban\, Calvin Barron\, Zach Gates\, Dylan Ross\, Brenzlee
  Johnson\, Kaelyn Wallin\, Carter Kinnett\, and Oscar Bernfield. Hailing f
 rom across the country and studying everything from Marketing to Piano Per
 formance\, FFC brings together a motley crew of students united by a timel
 ess college tradition: making each other laugh and hoping everyone else jo
 ins in. Full Frontal Comedy performs every other Friday in the State Room 
 East in the IMU. Follow @fullfrontaliu on Instagram for upcoming shows and
  more.
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, 123 S Walnut Street\, Bloomington\, IN
URL:https://www.comedyattic.com/shows/388820
X-SOURCE:The Comedy Attic
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Chloe Radcliffe Returns to The Comedy Attic
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261016T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261016T210000
UID:20261016-chloe-radcliffe-returns-to-the-comedy-at-1900
DESCRIPTION:Hailing from the Midwest and proud of it\, standup and actor C
 hloe Radcliffe can be seen in Bradley Cooper’s latest film Is This Thing
  On? She was named a Just For Laughs 2025 New Face \, along with one of De
 adline’s 15 Comedians Ready To Break Out In 2025 \, and one of Vulture
 ’s Comedians You Should And Will Know . So…get to knowin’ her\, for 
 chrissakes! A daredevil cyclist in NYC\, Chloe hosts In Tandem with Chloe 
 Radcliffe \, where she interviews other comedians while they ride a tandem
  bike together. Think Comedians in Cars\, but sweatier. Chloe’s one-woma
 n show CHEAT \, about her history of infidelity\, led The New York Times
 ’ recommendations for the New York Comedy Festival. She sold out her fu
 ll-month run at the 2023 Edinburgh Fringe Festival\, with reviews calling 
 it\, “Hilarious and sharply-crafted” (Deadline)\, “Worthy of the gre
 ats like Mike Birbiglia” (Chortle)\, and “A new take on an old topic\,
  with hard-hitting punchlines” (The New York Times). Chloe is currently 
 developing CHEAT for tv. Chloe starred in Steven Soderbergh’s COMMAND Z 
 \, and was nominated for a 2024 WGA award for her writing on the series. S
 he has been seen on Comedy Central \, Don’t Tell Comedy \, and After Mid
 night with Taylor Tomlinson . She was a staff writer on The Tonight Show 
 with Jimmy Fallon \, has a comedy feature in development with Sony\, and 
 was named a TBS Comic To Watch at the New York Comedy Festival.
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, 123 S Walnut Street\, Bloomington\, IN
URL:https://www.comedyattic.com/shows/376662
X-SOURCE:The Comedy Attic
END:VEVENT
