UID:20261113-shanda-s-back-in-the-attic-1900
DESCRIPTION:Shanda Sung is a comedian\, woman\, mother\, wife\, and human 
 being and she has opinions about all of it. Shanda is a Bloomington\, IN f
 avorite and regular at the renowned Comedy Attic. Her first special\, Pick
 les is now available on youtube and the album version can be found on itun
 es\, bandcamp and all streaming platforms. Her stand up has been enjoyed t
 hroughout the midwest at all manner of club\, theater\, bar\, winery and w
 affle restaurant.  She was featured on the album On Tour Live from Bloomi
 ngton and the premiere episode of the Vice network show Hunters. ​
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, 123 S Walnut Street\, Bloomington\, IN
URL:https://www.comedyattic.com/shows/390263
