BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SNL's Tommy Brennan Makes His Bloomington Debut!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261119T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261119T220000
UID:20261119-snl-s-tommy-brennan-makes-his-bloomingto-2000
DESCRIPTION:Tommy Brennan is a NY based standup comedian who got his start
  in Chicago. He recently joined the cast of Saturday Night Live for Season
  51. He was named one of Just For Laughs New Faces of 2023 at their premie
 re festival in Montreal. His standup has been featured on Comedy Central a
 nd Don’t Tell Comedy. He is a regular at The Comedy Cellar and tours acr
 oss the country. During his time getting to work with the late\, greatest 
 Louie Anderson\, Louie would often describe Tommy's set as "Alriiiiiiight"
 . It's been smooth sailing ever since (lie). Along with his standup\, you 
 may know Tommy from his web series Roommates-In-Law (co-created with fello
 w comic Tim Smith)\, which has amassed millions of views online.
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, 123 S Walnut Street\, Bloomington\, IN
URL:https://www.comedyattic.com/shows/382157
X-SOURCE:The Comedy Attic
END:VEVENT
