BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nateland's Brian Bates Makes His Comedy Attic Debut!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261218T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261218T210000
UID:20261218-nateland-s-brian-bates-makes-his-comedy--1900
DESCRIPTION:Comedian Brian Bates worked for nearly 20 years in corporate A
 merica until at the age of 43\, he gave up his day job to pivot into a car
 eer as a stand-up comedian. Since then\, the Nashville based comic has bee
 n touring the country performing at comedy clubs\, theaters\, corporate ev
 ents\, and churches. Brian has released two Dry Bar Comedy specials\, titl
 ed Uber Important and Hello Folks . His latest special\, titled Worried \,
  was released in July 2026 on the Nateland Entertainment YouTube channel. 
 As an originating member of the highly popular The Nateland Podcast \, Bri
 an served as a host and producer during the show’s six-year run. He now 
 works with fellow comedians Aaron Weber and Dusty Slay as one of the hosts
  and producers of The Public Figures Podcast \, heard by thousands of list
 eners each week. He performs regularly on the legendary Grand Ole Opry sho
 w and can be heard frequently on Pure Comedy Channel 98 on SiriusXM satell
 ite radio. In addition to stand-up comedy\, Brian made his acting debut ap
 pearing in two episodes of the 2022 Amazon sitcom Sprung . He most recentl
 y appeared in the 2026 Nate Bargatze movie The Breadwinner .
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, 123 S Walnut Street\, Bloomington\, IN
URL:https://www.comedyattic.com/shows/385678
X-SOURCE:The Comedy Attic
END:VEVENT
