UID:20270108-ruby-setnik-s-bloomington-debut-1900
DESCRIPTION:Ruby Setnik was a standout in the latest Netflix Introducing s
 howcase\, recorded in Los Angeles May 2025. Ruby started her stand up care
 er while she was still in high school. Now 25 years old and "way hotter\,"
  Ruby is described as "charismatic" and "unapologetic" in her style of jok
 e telling. Originally from Sacramento\, Ruby has made a name for herself i
 n New York and tours nationwide.
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, 123 S Walnut Street\, Bloomington\, IN
URL:https://www.comedyattic.com/shows/387441
